Package: limnoplots
Title: Ultra-Fast Plotting and Visualisation for Limnological Buoy and Profiler Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Chris", "McBride", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "chris@limnotrack.com")
Description: Fast, standardised plotting tools for profiling buoy, fixed-depth
    sensor, and meteorological data. Uses scattermore for rendering millions of
    points in seconds. Provides consistent multi-panel dot plots coloured by
    depth, raw/QC comparison overlays, met data panels, device timeline plots,
    and profile-by-profile visualisation. Designed for the wqprofiler data
    pipeline but works with any data frame of profiler/buoy data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
